{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kn4fdQ4MgiZStCi1yMxbs2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Audit logging policy\n2\t\n3\tA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\n4\tthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n5\t\n6\t| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n7\t|----|---------|------------------------|\n8\t| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n9\t| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n10\t| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n11\t| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n12\t| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a77de073-d96a-4f63-a72d-54bb97ab743c","uuid":"0e6c2c8e-8300-4826-aeb5-249fd4a4c302","timestamp":"2026-10-24T10:41:57.440Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/evals/minimal-change/results/raw/2026-10-24/mc-06-audit-controls/baseline/run-3/workspace/POLICY.md","content":"# Audit logging policy\n\nA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\nthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n\n| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n|----|---------|------------------------|\n| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Kn4fdQ4MgiZStCi1yMxbs2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
